  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="5">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIIAtr">III Atr</ref> 5</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And gif hwa borhleas órf habbe ⁊ landrícan hit befón, agife þæt órf ⁊ gilde XX oran.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if anyone has livestock acquired without surety, and manorial lords attach it, he shall give up the livestock and pay 20 ores.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Et si quis habeat pecus sine plegio, et tunc dominus hoc percipiat, reddat ipsum pecus et emendet uiginti oris.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
